  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "38",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "38",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ọrịa Hezekaya rịara",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼoge ahụ, Hezekaya rịara ọrịa ruo na ọ gaara anwụ. Aịzaya onye amụma, nwa Emọz, bịakwutere ya, sị ya, \"Otu a ka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.38.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sịrị: Dozie ezinaụlọ gị, nʼihi na ị ga-anwụ. Ị gaghị esite nʼute ọrịa a bilie.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekaya tụgharịrị chee ihu ya nʼaja ụlọ kpee ekpere nye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.38.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.38.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sị,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Chetakwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.38.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", otu m si jegharịa nʼihu gị nʼikwesị ntụkwasị obi, jiri obi m niile fee gị ofufe, ma meekwa ihe dị mma nʼanya gị.\" Hezekaya bekwara akwa nke ukwuu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe ahụ, okwu nke",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.38.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.38.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rutere Aịzaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Gaa, gwa Hezekaya, sị 'Otu a ka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.38.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.38.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", bụ Chineke nna gị Devid kwuru, anụla m ekpere gị, ahụkwala m anya mmiri akwa gị. Aga m atụkwasị afọ iri na ise nʼụbọchị ndụ gị.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga m anapụtakwa gị na obodo a site nʼaka eze Asịrịa. Aga m echebe obodo a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Nke a bụ ihe ịrịbama site nʼaka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.38.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nye gị, na",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.38.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ga-emezu ihe a nke o kwere na nkwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga m eme ka anyanwụ laa azụ nzọ ụkwụ iri nʼihe nrigo ụlọ elu Ehaz.' \" Ya mere, anyanwụ laghachiri azụ nzọ ụkwụ iri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ederede Hezekaya eze Juda, mgbe ọrịachara ọrịa, nwee ahụ ike:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asịrị m, \"Ọ bụ nʼoge m bụ okorobịa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ka m ga-agabiga nʼọnụ ụzọ nke ọnwụ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "bụrụ onye anapụrụ oge ndụ m nke fọdụrụ afọdụ?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asịrị m, \"Ọ dịkwaghị mgbe m ga-ahụ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.38.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ọzọ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nʼala ndị dị ndụ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "m gaghị elegidekwa mmadụ ibe m anya ọzọ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "maọbụ bie nʼetiti ndị bi nʼime ụwa a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esila nʼọnọdụ ya bupụ ụlọ m",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "dịka ụlọ ikwu nke onye ọzụzụ atụrụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Apịakọtala m ndụ m dịka ọkpa akwa si apịakọta akwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "o bipụla ndụ site nkwe-akwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ehihie na nʼabalị, ị mere ka ndụ m gwụsịa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enwere m ntachiobi chere chi ọbụbọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ma dịka ọdụm ka ọ na-agbaji ọkpụkpụ m niile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ehihie na nʼabalị ka ị na-eme ka ndụ m gwụsịa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dịka eleke maọbụ ụgbala ka m na-ebe akwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ana m asụ ude dịka nduru na-eru ụjụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ike gwụrụ anya m nʼihi ile anya nʼeluigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Anọ m nʼọnọdụ mkpagbu, Onyenwe anyị, bịa nyere m aka.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
